### 东信和平库位-巷道灯绑定接口测试
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8090

### 0. 查询巷道灯设备列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/location/led-devices

### 1. 创建绑定-成功
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/location/led-mapping
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lotNo": "LOT_PDA_20260404_001",
  "ledId": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:01",
  "color": "RED"
}

### 2. 创建绑定-重复绑定（预期失败）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/location/led-mapping
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lotNo": "LOT_PDA_20260404_001",
  "ledId": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:02",
  "color": "YELLOW"
}

### 3. 删除绑定-成功
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/location/led-mapping?lotNo=LOT_PDA_20260404_001

### 4. 删除绑定-不存在记录
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/location/led-mapping?lotNo=LOT_PDA_20260404_999

### 5. 创建绑定-缺少 lotNo（后端侧）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/location/led-mapping
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ledId": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:03",
  "color": "GREEN"
}

### 6. 创建绑定-二维码格式输入（双引号开头，取 Lot 字段）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/location/led-mapping
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lotNo": "\"OrdNo\":\"2025122365-1+01\";\"Lot\":\"A1-11-01-01-01\";\"Qty\":\"170\"",
  "ledId": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:04",
  "color": "RED"
}
